        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses lifted up his hand, and struck the rock with his rod twice, and water came out abundantly. The congregation and their livestock drank.",
      "ko": "그 손을 들어 그 지팡이로 반석을 두번 치매 물이 많이 솟아나오므로 회중과 그들의 짐승이 마시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "9b9ea0b5f04f84ba4a1ea9011ee16bb65b9eba5ad8b2b9b392b7345b62290c64",
      "translation_text_hash": "930231d3509b376e8be17984b3f3c9de7e1e8d52a9d315f3593fa2fa9c84d553",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
