        {
          "book": "NUM",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "These are the waters of Meribah; because the children of Israel strove with the LORD, and he was sanctified in them.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손이 여호와와 다투었으므로 이를 므리바 물이라 하니라 여호와께서 그들 중에서 그 거룩함을 나타내셨더라",
      "source_text_hash": "82a6f189afb4ed2b593932dc7394d306d0d70ac965ce3a21e551f24cef6dfb3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ecc1ce49bc257e7531c8ed03232443f1220172d033ea5e4eb0ad57f9f525c4a",
